    {
      "text": "It is believed that seeing this Pokémon at night will bring about ominous occurrences.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It appears near travelers to lure them into deep forests. It is said to carry misfortune.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.",
